## ALTTPR (`alttp_vt_randomizer`) — randomizer logic provenance

The Phase A logic graph in `assets/rando/logic.yaml`, the 43 named macros in
`assets/rando/macros.yaml`, and the canonical location/region/prize naming
in `assets/rando/location_registry.yaml` were hand-translated from the
ALTTPR PHP randomizer (`alttp_vt_randomizer`) per audit.md §0.10. Each
translated artifact carries an inline `source: app/<path>:<line-range>`
citation pointing back to the upstream PHP source.

